OpenWings patch 0006: Agents and Files in the sidebar, theme follows the OS

Adds an 'Agents' sidebar entry (keyboard-focusable) that opens the persona
editor where an agent's instructions and tool access live, relabels the
document Library as 'Files & Docs', and makes the default theme follow the
operating system's light/dark preference when the user has not picked one
(upstream always started dark).

Applies to: odysseus-dev/odysseus@9d0d3720f4ca181d87bef94da826d730acc6d483
License: AGPL-3.0-or-later (same as upstream)

